---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '@components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE, SOCIAL } from '@lib/site';

/**
 * /community/ was live on the old WordPress site. Kept as a real page rather
 * than a bare 301 to Substack: a redirect hands the URL's value to a domain
 * that is not ours, and gives the visitor no idea what they are joining.
 */
---

<Base
  title="The community — product people who ship"
  description="A small Substack chat for people building products: what you’re stuck on, what you got wrong, and what it cost. No promotion, no growth hacks, no lurking gurus."
>
  <Header slot="nav" />

  <section class="col intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">Community</span>
    <h1>Somewhere to say<br />what is not working.</h1>
    <p class="sub">
      A small chat on Substack for people building products. You bring the thing you’re stuck
      on, other people tell you what they tried. That’s the whole format.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn--dark" href={SOCIAL.community} rel="noopener">Join the chat</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/writing/">Read something first</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section col">
    <h2>What it’s not.</h2>
    <ul class="nots">
      <li>Not a Slack you will mute in four days.</li>
      <li>Not a place to post your launch.</li>
      <li>Not a course, a cohort, or a funnel with a nice name.</li>
      <li>Not free advice from me on demand — I’m in there as one more person.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="sub small">
      It’s on Substack because it’s one login you already have, and because if it ever stops
      being useful you can leave in one click. Both of those matter more than they sound.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn btn--dark" href={SOCIAL.community} rel="noopener">Join the chat</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Base>

<style>
  .intro { padding-top: clamp(52px, 9vh, 84px); }
  .intro h1 { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .intro .actions { margin-top: 30px; }

  .nots { list-style: none; text-align: left; margin: 34px 0 30px; }
  .nots li {
    padding: 16px 0;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--dim);
  }
  .nots li + li { border-top: 1px solid var(--hair); }
  .small { font-size: 1rem; }
  .actions { margin-top: 28px; }
</style>
